  "content": "[Intro]\n[Asus4]\n[Bsus4]\n[Esus2]\n[Asus4]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Asus4]\n[Csus4]\n[Asus4]\n[Csus4]\n\n[Guitar Solo 1]\n[C]\n[Cadd9]\n[Dm/C]\n[Csus4]\n[C]\n[Csus4]\n[Dm/C]\n[Csus4]\n[C]\n[Csus4]\n[Dm/C]\n[Csus4]\n[C]\n[G]\n[Ab]\n[F]\nIn a\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Esus2]dark and lonely cor-\nner of a\n[C/E]timeworn dockside inn\nSits the\n[A/E]local barstool war-\nrior,\ntalking to his gin\n[Esus2]Tracing past deci-\nsions, he\n[C/E]motions for a shot\nIs he\n[A/E]doomed to be a man\nthis world forgot?\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[A]\nJust a pri-\n[F]soner of the mon-\nster on his\n[G/F]back\nCall it bad\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]luck, call it\n[Cadd9]fate Call it\n[F/C]stuck here the rest of my\n[Fm/C]days Serves me\n[C]right, what went\n[Gm]wrong And\n[Ab]where do I be-\n[F]long?\n[Asus4]\nIn the\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Esus2]glow of flashing\nlights, on the\n[Cadd9]shoulder of the\nroad\n[Bm]Clutching at the\nbruises on her\n[A]skin\nShe\n[Esus2]tries to signal\ndanger with\n[Cadd9]anguish in her\neyes\n[D]Will he see the\nworld of pain she's\n[A]in?\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[F]Or is it too\n[G/F]late? Was it bad\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]luck, was it\n[Cadd9]fate Or a\n[F/C]past that she couldn't es-\n[Fm/C]cape? It's not\n[C]right, something's\n[Gm]wrong Just\n[Ab/C]where do I be-\n[F/C]long?\n\n[Guitar Solo 2]\n[C]\n[Cadd9]\n[F/C]\n[Fm/C]\n[C]\n[Gm]\n[Ab]\n[F]\n[G]  [F]\n[Eb]  [D]\n[Cm]\n\n[Piano Solo]\n[Cm]\n[Fm]\n[Bb]\n[Gm]\n[Cm]\n[Ab]\n[Bbsus4]\n[Gm]\n[Cm]\n[Ab]\n[Bb]\n[Gm]\n[Cm]\n[Ab]\n[Bbsus4]\n[Bb]\n\n[Guitar Solo 3]\n[Gm]\n[Eb]\n[F]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[Eb]\n[F]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[Eb]\n[F]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[Eb]\n[F]\n[Dm]Promises\n\n[Bridge]\n[Gm]made, crying in\n[Ebsus2]vain All\n[F]empty,\n[Dm]never accepting the blame\n[Gm]And\n[Ebsus2]not letting go of the shame\n[F]\nA river of\n[Gm]tears, as months turn to years\n[Ebsus2]All\n[F]wasted on\n[Dm]someone not willing to change\n[Gm]Now\n[Ebsus2]only a shadow remains\n[F]\n[Dm]No one can\n[Eb]save you And there's\n[Eb/G]no one to\n[F/A]save\n[Dm]It has been\n[F/A]written\n[Csus4]You will be-\n[Bbsus4]come all you\n[Emmaj7/A]think, all you\n[Eb]feel, [D]all you\n\n[Outro]\n[G]dream Now I'm\n[D/G]cutting the anchor away\n[Am/G]And I\n[Cm]won't look\n[G]back I'm\n[D/G]starting a new life today\n[Ebsus2]\n[Cm]\n[Bb]\n[Eb/G]Now I\n[F/A]see where\n[Gsus2]I [F]be-\n[G]long",
